1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,308
A line of ants marching across your
kitchen counter?

2
00:00:04,110 --> 00:00:06,154
You don't have to spray chemicals around
your

3
00:00:06,164 --> 00:00:07,266
food and pets.

4
00:00:07,627 --> 00:00:10,796
Seven natural steps to find them, block
them

5
00:00:10,855 --> 00:00:14,314
and keep them out, indoors and in the
garden.

6
00:00:15,278 --> 00:00:19,236
Stay for step three: it erases the trail
they follow.

7
00:00:19,867 --> 00:00:20,841
WikiTube.

8
00:00:21,016 --> 00:00:23,360
Whatever it is, here's how.

9
00:00:23,633 --> 00:00:27,463
Ants follow invisible scent trails left by
scouts,

10
00:00:27,522 --> 00:00:30,273
so one crumb can bring a whole colony.

11
00:00:31,075 --> 00:00:34,025
To stop them for good, remove what
attracts

12
00:00:34,035 --> 00:00:38,086
them, erase their trails, and block the
ways in.

13
00:00:39,051 --> 00:00:42,686
Keep oils, powders and cleaners away from
pets

14
00:00:42,696 --> 00:00:45,888
and children, and never mix products.

15
00:00:46,433 --> 00:00:48,397
You'll need white vinegar and water in a

16
00:00:48,407 --> 00:00:52,577
spray bottle, food-grade diatomaceous
earth, a tube of

17
00:00:52,587 --> 00:00:55,546
caulk for cracks, and a soapy sponge.

18
00:00:55,907 --> 00:00:58,379
Keep essential oils away from pets.

19
00:00:58,933 --> 00:01:00,012
Step one.

20
00:01:00,303 --> 00:01:03,541
Don't kill the ants you see, at least at
first.

21
00:01:04,204 --> 00:01:06,516
Follow the line, and watch where they come

22
00:01:06,526 --> 00:01:08,197
from and where they go.

23
00:01:08,558 --> 00:01:10,916
This shows you the entry point, which
could

24
00:01:10,926 --> 00:01:13,110
be a crack in a window frame, a

25
00:01:13,120 --> 00:01:16,626
gap under a door or a hole around a pipe.

26
00:01:17,172 --> 00:01:19,473
It also shows you what they want, such

27
00:01:19,483 --> 00:01:21,885
as a sugary spill or pet food.

28
00:01:22,548 --> 00:01:25,182
Knowing the source lets you fix the cause,

29
00:01:25,276 --> 00:01:27,922
rather than chasing the symptoms every
week.

30
00:01:29,073 --> 00:01:31,245
Take a photo if you can, because it

31
00:01:31,255 --> 00:01:33,031
helps you remember the route.

32
00:01:33,567 --> 00:01:34,565
Step two.

33
00:01:34,926 --> 00:01:37,990
Wipe all counters, tables and floors.

34
00:01:38,444 --> 00:01:41,612
Clean up sticky spills, crumbs and grease.

35
00:01:42,158 --> 00:01:46,456
Store sugar, honey, flour and cereal in

36
00:01:46,466 --> 00:01:50,946
airtight containers, and put pet food away
after meals.

37
00:01:51,748 --> 00:01:55,346
Fix leaking taps and wipe sinks dry at
night.

38
00:01:56,311 --> 00:01:58,040
Ants need water too.

39
00:01:58,842 --> 00:02:02,185
Empty your trash often, and rinse
recycling.

40
00:02:03,149 --> 00:02:05,996
A clean kitchen removes the reward, and
the

41
00:02:06,006 --> 00:02:08,930
ants will gradually give up and look
elsewhere.

42
00:02:09,291 --> 00:02:13,194
Check under appliances and inside
cupboards too, where

43
00:02:13,204 --> 00:02:15,653
crumbs and moisture often hide.

44
00:02:16,200 --> 00:02:17,360
Step three.

45
00:02:17,651 --> 00:02:20,509
Mix equal parts white vinegar and water in

46
00:02:20,519 --> 00:02:21,667
a spray bottle.

47
00:02:22,632 --> 00:02:24,967
Spray it on the ants' trail, and wipe

48
00:02:24,977 --> 00:02:27,800
the area with a cloth, then repeat along

49
00:02:27,810 --> 00:02:30,595
the whole route, including the entry
point.

50
00:02:31,745 --> 00:02:34,313
Vinegar breaks down the scent markers the
ants

51
00:02:34,323 --> 00:02:37,944
use to find their way, so scouts get
confused.

52
00:02:38,909 --> 00:02:42,091
Use soapy water as an alternative, which
also

53
00:02:42,101 --> 00:02:43,924
kills ants on contact.

54
00:02:44,586 --> 00:02:46,605
Do this daily for a few days.

55
00:02:47,059 --> 00:02:50,147
Avoid spraying vinegar on natural stone
counters.

56
00:02:50,600 --> 00:02:54,317
Always wear gloves, and ventilate the
room, since

57
00:02:54,327 --> 00:02:57,217
a strong vinegar smell can bother some
people.

58
00:02:57,767 --> 00:02:58,753
Step four.

59
00:02:59,207 --> 00:03:02,689
Once you know where the ants enter, close
the gap.

60
00:03:03,653 --> 00:03:07,089
Use silicone caulk to fill cracks around
windows,

61
00:03:07,264 --> 00:03:09,980
doors, baseboards and pipes.

62
00:03:10,944 --> 00:03:15,239
Fit weatherstripping on doors, and repair
damaged window screens.

63
00:03:16,389 --> 00:03:19,604
Seal small holes in the wall around
cables.

64
00:03:20,755 --> 00:03:23,227
Doing this is a long-term fix.

65
00:03:23,889 --> 00:03:27,362
Without entry points, the ants cannot
return, however

66
00:03:27,372 --> 00:03:28,835
many scouts come by.

67
00:03:29,985 --> 00:03:33,003
Let the caulk dry completely before moving
on.

68
00:03:33,363 --> 00:03:37,278
Use a flashlight to check dark corners,
since

69
00:03:37,288 --> 00:03:40,921
ants like to hide behind skirting boards
and cabinets.

70
00:03:41,467 --> 00:03:42,546
Step five.

71
00:03:42,907 --> 00:03:45,948
Ants dislike certain smells and barriers.

72
00:03:46,309 --> 00:03:49,315
Draw a line of ground cinnamon, black
pepper

73
00:03:49,374 --> 00:03:52,240
or used coffee grounds across their path.

74
00:03:53,391 --> 00:03:55,874
Wipe doorways with lemon juice.

75
00:03:56,421 --> 00:03:59,743
A thin line of food-grade diatomaceous
earth is

76
00:03:59,753 --> 00:04:02,390
a natural option, because it dries out the

77
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:04,048
insects that cross it.

78
00:04:04,850 --> 00:04:07,359
Use it where it stays dry, and avoid

79
00:04:07,369 --> 00:04:08,680
breathing the dust.

80
00:04:09,830 --> 00:04:12,430
Reapply after rain or cleaning.

81
00:04:13,232 --> 00:04:16,531
These methods block rather than kill, so
combine

82
00:04:16,541 --> 00:04:18,305
them with the previous steps.

83
00:04:18,666 --> 00:04:20,664
Keep pets out of the area while the

84
00:04:20,674 --> 00:04:24,388
powder is down, and clean up after a few
days.

85
00:04:24,933 --> 00:04:26,093
Step six.

86
00:04:26,454 --> 00:04:30,598
Outdoors, ants often farm aphids on your
plants.

87
00:04:30,959 --> 00:04:33,538
Rinse the aphids away with a strong spray

88
00:04:33,548 --> 00:04:37,044
of water, or with soapy water, and the

89
00:04:37,054 --> 00:04:38,725
ants will lose interest.

90
00:04:39,689 --> 00:04:43,580
Sprinkle food-grade diatomaceous earth
around the plants and

91
00:04:43,590 --> 00:04:46,259
along the nest entrance on a dry day.

92
00:04:47,062 --> 00:04:50,651
Pour very hot, not boiling, water onto a

93
00:04:50,661 --> 00:04:54,328
nest in a paved area, away from plant
roots.

94
00:04:55,293 --> 00:04:58,127
Keep mulch thin near the house, and trim

95
00:04:58,137 --> 00:05:00,145
any branches touching the walls.

96
00:05:00,599 --> 00:05:02,504
Do this in the morning, when the ground

97
00:05:02,514 --> 00:05:05,718
is cool, and check again the next day.

98
00:05:06,267 --> 00:05:07,323
Step seven.

99
00:05:08,125 --> 00:05:11,317
Natural methods need repeating for a week
or two.

100
00:05:12,281 --> 00:05:15,415
Keep wiping trails and reapplying
barriers.

101
00:05:15,776 --> 00:05:18,620
Check for new entry points after heavy
rain.

102
00:05:19,584 --> 00:05:22,253
If you see large ants with winged forms,

103
00:05:22,278 --> 00:05:25,217
sawdust near wood, or a colony that keeps

104
00:05:25,227 --> 00:05:28,316
returning, it could be carpenter ants or
another

105
00:05:28,326 --> 00:05:32,041
structural problem, so call a pest control
professional.

106
00:05:33,006 --> 00:05:34,897
Prevention is the key.

107
00:05:35,862 --> 00:05:38,824
Keep the kitchen clean, the cracks sealed
and

108
00:05:38,834 --> 00:05:40,075
the garden tidy.

109
00:05:40,436 --> 00:05:42,562
Keep a notebook of where and when ants

110
00:05:42,572 --> 00:05:45,938
appear, because patterns will tell you
where to look.

111
00:05:46,500 --> 00:05:49,254
If ants keep coming back, they probably
have

112
00:05:49,264 --> 00:05:50,354
another way in.

113
00:05:51,319 --> 00:05:53,874
Watch for a second trail, and check damp

114
00:05:53,884 --> 00:05:57,668
spots, such as under sinks and around
window frames.

115
00:05:58,215 --> 00:06:01,488
Ants love moisture, so fix any leak.

116
00:06:02,034 --> 00:06:05,438
Look outside too, because plants or
branches touching

117
00:06:05,448 --> 00:06:07,269
the wall act as bridges.

118
00:06:07,932 --> 00:06:10,000
Keep wiping with vinegar every day for a

119
00:06:10,010 --> 00:06:10,938
week or two.

120
00:06:11,299 --> 00:06:14,932
A new trail only means another entry point
to close.

121
00:06:15,467 --> 00:06:18,857
Knowing which ants you have makes the fix
easier.

122
00:06:19,821 --> 00:06:23,222
Look at the size, the color and how they
move.

123
00:06:23,583 --> 00:06:25,811
Take a clear photo of a few ants,

124
00:06:25,835 --> 00:06:27,739
or tape one to a card.

125
00:06:28,889 --> 00:06:31,874
A local garden center or pest control
service

126
00:06:31,884 --> 00:06:34,438
can often identify them from a photo.

127
00:06:34,891 --> 00:06:37,273
Note where and when you see them, such

128
00:06:37,283 --> 00:06:38,722
as at night in the kitchen.

129
00:06:39,268 --> 00:06:42,869
That record helps you, or a pro, decide

130
00:06:42,879 --> 00:06:44,225
where to focus.

131
00:06:44,767 --> 00:06:47,901
Trim branches and shrubs that touch the
walls.

132
00:06:48,448 --> 00:06:51,108
Move mulch and firewood a few inches away

133
00:06:51,118 --> 00:06:52,429
from the foundation.

134
00:06:52,976 --> 00:06:56,321
Keep trash can lids shut, and rinse
recycling

135
00:06:56,331 --> 00:06:57,619
before you store it.

136
00:06:58,165 --> 00:07:00,535
Empty the pet water bowl at night, and

137
00:07:00,545 --> 00:07:02,123
wipe up pet food.

138
00:07:02,786 --> 00:07:05,226
Inside, check the fruit bowl and the
corners

139
00:07:05,236 --> 00:07:06,942
of the pantry each week.

140
00:07:07,395 --> 00:07:10,831
Ants only stay where they find something
to eat.

141
00:07:11,367 --> 00:07:13,282
Here are the mistakes to avoid.

142
00:07:14,246 --> 00:07:18,414
First, spraying the visible ants without
removing the food source.

143
00:07:18,775 --> 00:07:19,981
More will come.

144
00:07:21,132 --> 00:07:24,744
Second, using strong chemicals or
essential oils around

145
00:07:24,754 --> 00:07:26,030
pets and children.

146
00:07:26,484 --> 00:07:30,070
Even natural products can be harmful in
the wrong place.

147
00:07:30,431 --> 00:07:33,495
And third, giving up too early.

148
00:07:34,158 --> 00:07:37,538
Natural methods work through repetition,
so keep it

149
00:07:37,548 --> 00:07:39,115
up for at least a week.

150
00:07:40,265 --> 00:07:42,740
If the problem keeps growing, there may be

151
00:07:42,750 --> 00:07:44,072
a nest in your wall.

152
00:07:44,433 --> 00:07:46,977
Also remember that the ants you see are

153
00:07:46,987 --> 00:07:49,520
only a small part of the colony, so

154
00:07:49,530 --> 00:07:52,292
the real fix is cutting off their supply.

155
00:07:52,955 --> 00:07:57,217
Be patient, be consistent, and be careful
around

156
00:07:57,227 --> 00:07:58,097
pets.

157
00:07:58,633 --> 00:07:59,758
Let's recap.

158
00:08:00,305 --> 00:08:02,510
Find the trail and the entry point.

159
00:08:03,056 --> 00:08:05,168
Clean up food and water sources.

160
00:08:05,459 --> 00:08:07,803
Erase the scent trails with vinegar.

161
00:08:08,164 --> 00:08:09,998
Seal the entry points.

162
00:08:10,962 --> 00:08:15,095
Use natural deterrents like cinnamon or
diatomaceous earth.

163
00:08:16,245 --> 00:08:18,995
Deal with ants and aphids in the garden.

164
00:08:19,287 --> 00:08:23,036
And be consistent, and know when to call a
professional.

165
00:08:24,186 --> 00:08:27,972
Seven steps, no harsh chemicals, and a
kitchen

166
00:08:27,982 --> 00:08:29,700
that stays ant free.

167
00:08:30,850 --> 00:08:34,413
Remove, erase, block, and repeat.

168
00:08:34,960 --> 00:08:37,446
Bonus sections cover what to do if the

169
00:08:37,456 --> 00:08:40,883
ants keep coming, how to identify them,
and

170
00:08:40,893 --> 00:08:42,761
how to keep them out for good.

171
00:08:43,300 --> 00:08:45,726
That's how you get rid of ants naturally,

172
00:08:45,901 --> 00:08:47,862
in the kitchen and the garden.

173
00:08:48,525 --> 00:08:51,220
If your counters are ant free, subscribe
to

174
00:08:51,230 --> 00:08:55,687
WikiTube, because we publish a new how-to
every single day.

175
00:08:56,837 --> 00:08:58,801
Tell us in the comments where your ants

176
00:08:58,811 --> 00:09:00,937
were coming from, and what you would like

177
00:09:00,947 --> 00:09:02,688
us to explain next.

178
00:09:03,838 --> 00:09:04,929
See you tomorrow.

179
00:09:05,220 --> 00:09:07,079
Don't forget to share this with a friend

180
00:09:07,089 --> 00:09:08,806
who has an ant problem.

181
